  "pedal": "Boss RV-6 Reverb (stereo: Input A -> Outputs A and B; Input B and EXP empty)",
  "comment": "First RV-6 session (user, 2026-10-31): Modulate, Spring, Plate, Hall, Room, Shimmer (the Mode knob's order) (Dynamic and +Delay left out), stereo. Per mode at noon: a 50 ms noise burst (the tail: decay, density, stereo, modulation), a sweep (the dry path and the linear part of the tail) and plucks; Time at both ends with bursts. Tone at both ends in Hall and Spring; Level at both ends in Hall. Tails grow with Time (4/8/15 s). Output A -> input 2, Output B -> input 1, both INST + pad, gain minimum. Clock positions are strings: 7:00 = 0, 5:00 = 1.",
